                      {loser?.name} loses the point with a {p.location?.toLowerCase()} {p.errorType?.toLowerCase()} {p.shotSide?.toLowerCase()} {p.shotKind?.toLowerCase()} {p.outcome.toLowerCase()}.
                    </p>
                 </div>
               );
             })}
           </div>
        )}
      </div>

      {/* Point Modal Overlay */}
      {pointModal.show && (
